p><br/>\nIn a small cave in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>, the ferocious <a href=\"#/wiki/Stampor\">Stampors</a> can be fought. The cave can be found just outside of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a>.\n</p><p>The main cave is connected to a second cave trough a teleporter near the entrance. This cave also has a one way rope spot that acts as an escape route to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppe</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stampor\"><img alt=\"Stampor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stampor_b81d53.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Stampor\">Stampor</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">780</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">400</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-242× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× Stampor Talons (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Stampor Horn (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Hollow Stampor Hoof (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Hammer\">War Hammer</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Armor\">Knight Armor</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Spiked Squelcher (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":[]}